      "content": "it's just... i look at the crowds in the lower sectors and all i see are ghosts. people just walking, breathing, pretending there's a tomorrow when we all know there isn't. i look at my hands and i feel so heavy. like i'm just waiting for something to finally just stop. do you think anyone actually finds a way out of here? or is it all just a loop?",
